ronology</i> 3, 123–147.","doi":"10.5194/gchron-3-123-2021","url":null,"note":"Direct epidote U–Pb dating.","tags":["geochronology"]},{"citation":"Gabe, E.J., Portheine, J.C., Whitlow, S.H. (1973). A reinvestigation of the epidote structure: confirmation of the iron location. <i>American Mineralogist</i> 58, 218–223.","doi":null,"url":"http://www.minsocam.org/ammin/AM58/AM58_218.pdf","note":"The cell used here.","tags":["lattice"]}],"cells":[{"id":"1c","row":0,"col":0,"label":"1c","sub":"","title":"1c: short-prismatic along b, 1.5:1 · prism zone flattened on (001)","description":"short-prismatic along b, 1.5:1; prism zone flattened on (001).","default":false,"params":{"face_distances":{"001":0.6,"100":0.9,"-101":0.9,"101":1.0,"-111":1.0,"011":1.05},"cap_translation":0.2756,"scale":0.59165872,"planes":{"001":0.35499523,"100":0.53249285,"-101":0.53249285,"101":0.59165872,"-111":0.72484323,"011":0.7602265}},"fractions":{"001":0.3826,"100":0.1727,"-101":0.1402,"-111":0.2098,"011":0.0947},"metrics":{"volume":1.0,"surface_area":5.69793,"rsv":0.52651,"sphericity":0.84872,"aspect":1.5},"geometry":{"vertices":[[0.53249,-0.5113,-0.25798],[0.22591,-0.5113,-0.50012],[-0.53249,-0.5113,0.25798],[-0.22591,-0.5113,0.50012],[0.00639,-0.88745,0.00504],[0.00639,-0.67411,0.3899],[0.53249,-0.67411,0.14027],[0.53249,-0.70309,0.08799],[-0.53249,-0.67411,-0.14027],[-0.53249,-0.70309,-0.08799],[-0.00639,-0.67411,-0.3899],[-0.00639,-0.88745,-0.00504],[-0.22591,0.5113,0.50012],[-0.53249,0.5113,0.25798],[-0.53249,0.67411,-0.14027],[-0.53249,0.70309,-0.08799],[0.22591,0.5113,-0.50012],[-0.00639,0.67411,-0.3899],[0.53249,0.5113,-0.25798],[-0.00639,0.88745,-0.00504],[0.00639,0.67411,0.3899],[0.00639,0.88745,0.00504],[0.53249,0.67411,0.14027],[0.53249,0.70309,0.08799]],"faces":[{"form":"001","hkl":[0,0,1],"loop":[22,20,12,3,5,6]},{"form":"001","hkl":[0,0,-1],"loop":[14,17,16,1,10,8]},{"form":"100","hkl":[1,0,0],"loop":[6,7,0,18,23,22]},{"form":"100","hkl":[-1,0,0],"loop":[8,9,2,13,15,14]},{"form":